      conversation: I am lacking energy¡¦I need more sugar... How about I give you the invitation to Pumpkin Graveyard and you get me candies from the Pumpkin Witch?    If you bring me a lot, I'll give you something good in return!  --------------------------------------------------------------------------- 18 Big Halloween Candies = Grim Reaper's Costume Box (30D)   10 Big Halloween Candies= Grim Reaper's Costume Box (15D)   30 Special Halloween Candies = Grim Reaper's Wing Costume Box(Permanent)
